{"version":1,"content":"\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1024\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261014%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9C%E9%87%8D%E9%BB%9E%E6%A1%88%E4%BB%B6%E9%80%9F%E8%A6%BD_01-1024x1024.png\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p>\n<p><a href=\"https://linktr.ee/hkcourtnews\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">訂閱《庭刊》</a></p>\n</p>\n<p>🔸高等法院<br/>► 1000　10庭　暫委法官祁彥輝<br/>蔡天鳳碎屍案　前夫、家翁及大伯被控謀殺等罪｜續審<br/>► 0930　35庭　法官游德康<br/>匡智會性侵案　男助理舍監5項強姦罪成｜判刑</p>\n<p>🔸區域法院<br/>► 1000　36庭　法官張潔宜<br/>時事評論員王岸然被控違反「23條」｜續審</p>\n<p>🔸西九龍法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　主任裁判官蘇文隆<br/>六旬婦涉寓所門窗展示煽動旗幟等｜開審</p>\n<p>🔸九龍城法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　署理主任裁判官鄭念慈<br/>報販「霞姐」被殺案　男子27年後落網被控謀殺罪｜再提堂<br/>年幼姊弟疑誤服大麻糖案　母親涉虐兒還柙　姑婆被控管有危險藥物｜再提堂</p>\n<p>🔸東區法院<br/>► 0930　1庭　總裁判官蘇惠德<br/>車禍女乘客自行求醫一周後死亡　休班警被改控危險駕駛｜答辯</p>\n<hr/>\n<p>「重點法庭案件速覽」是根據法庭日誌內，我們認為大眾會關注的翌日案件，選取出來以方便讀者閱覽</p>\n<figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://qr.payme.hsbc.com.hk/2/QrndvPxDgEi2MhNiNPz4b8\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"916\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/%E5%BA%AD%E5%88%8A%EF%BD%9CHKCourtNews_PayMe_QR_code.png\" width=\"716\"/></a></figure>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1080\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://hkcourtnews.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/05/hkcourtnews_Octopus_QRcode_Payment_v4.png\" width=\"1080\"/></figure>\n</figure>\n<p><strong>如欲接收每日報道整合，請在訊息欄內填寫電郵地址</strong></p>\n<p></p>\n","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:06.198824+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":398,"images":3,"source":"法庭線","fallback":"rss-blocked"},"published_at":"2026-10-13T14:04:01+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.724068+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:54.724068+00:00","content_hash":"7516a299f56e452e1e16adc3c340675bd621113a45da30f9a3bb9e68f3994a7d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":"HTTP 403","content_retention":null}